  "material_learning": "Blocking weekend DRA entries did not create transferable risk-adjusted value. The primary's 26.79 USDT Design total-PnL uplift came with 22.72 USDT less realized PnL and 49.51 USDT less negative terminal unrealized inventory, so it was inventory cleanup rather than independent realized alpha. In Validation it lost 2.96 USDT total and 6.16 USDT realized PnL, increased drawdown by 3.90 percentage points, more than doubled P90 holding time, and extended maximum underwater duration by 724 hours. Both nested neighbors also lost Validation PnL and worsened path risk.",
